<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Experiment 5</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
    h1 { text-align: center; }
    section { border: 1px solid #444; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .bold-heading { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; }
    .justified { text-align: justify; font-style: italic; text-decoration: underline; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 60%; }
    th, td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 6px 12px; text-align: left; }
    .figure { display: inline-block; width: 160px; height: 200px; border: 2px dashed #555;
              text-align: center; line-height: 200px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .shapes { margin-top: 16px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
    .rect { width: 80px; height: 50px; background: #4a90d9; }
    .circle { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e67e22; }
    .tri { width: 0; height: 0; border-left: 30px solid transparent; border-right: 30px solid transparent;
           border-bottom: 55px solid #27ae60; }
    .letter { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 12px 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Experiment 5</h1>

  <!-- 5.1 Text Formatting Tools -->
  <section>
    <h2>5.1 Text Formatting Tools</h2>
    <h2 class="bold-heading">Bold Heading</h2>
    <p class="justified">
      Demonstrated character formatting and text layout alignment options are shown in this
      practical exercise. The paragraph was italicized and underlined text style and is
      justified between the left and right margins, filling the space evenly.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- 5.2 Insert Operations -->
  <section>
    <h2>5.2 Insert Operations (Table, Pictures, Shapes)</h2>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Sr. No</th><th>Name</th><th>Dept</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>1.</td><td>Smith J.</td><td>Sales</td></tr>
        <tr><td>2.</td><td>Arun</td><td>HR</td></tr>
        <tr><td>3.</td><td>Arpit</td><td>IT</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <!-- Replace src with your own campus image file -->
    <div class="figure">Campus Image</div>
    <!-- <img src="campus.jpg" alt="Campus Image" width="160" height="200"> -->

    <div class="shapes">
      <div class="rect"></div>
      <div class="circle"></div>
      <div class="tri"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5.3 Mail Merge Process -->
  <section>
    <h2>5.3 Mail Merge Process</h2>
    <div class="letter">
      <p>
        To,<br>
        &laquo;First_Name&raquo; &laquo;Last_Name&raquo;,<br>
        &laquo;Address&raquo;
      </p>
      <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Official Invitation</p>
      <p>Dear &laquo;First_Name&raquo;, you are invited to the event.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</body>
</html>
